## Usage

### 1. Dataset loading and accuracy evaluation

```bash
python setup_load.py \
    --model_name meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct \
    --task task1 \
    --dataset adj \
    --test_acc
```

### 2. PCA visualization

```bash
python pca_visualization.py \
    --model_name meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct \
    --task task1 \
    --dataset adj \
    --layer 11 \
    --load_in_4bit \
    --output_dir pca_outputs
```

### 3. Activation patching

```bash
python activation_patching.py \
    --model_name meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct \
    --task task1 \
    --dataset all \
    --load_in_4bit \
    --output_dir patching_outputs
```

### options:
--task: task1 (identification) or task2 (interpretation).

--dataset: adj, noun, or verb for Task 1; noun or verb for Task 2 (except where restricted by the script).

For activation patching, all currently runs adjective and noun pairs for Task 1, and noun pairs for Task 2.

